<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27% (Discount)	  C/S =  2.55%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  Par			   O/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27%			 T/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>		   Jan  15, 1997			Jan 14, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.09%	1 month forward =  5.77%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.28%	2 month forward =  6.45%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.13%	3 month forward =  7.24%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.38%	4 month forward =  7.55%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.40%	5 month forward =  7.60%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.36%	6 month forward =  7.54%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
